09/semantic-kg-final-issue-pr-map.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-final-artifact-inventory.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-rag-hvy-next-chain-recommendation.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-final-closeout.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-final-closeout.readback.md`\n\n## Counts\n- Required artifacts: 52 present / 0 missing\n- Validator failures: 0\n- Represented rows: 3530\n- Raw candidates / terminal blockers: 3 / 3527\n- Accepted/provisional/review/rejected/blocked: 0 / 0 / 3 / 0 / 3527\n- Semantic review tasks / high-risk review tasks: 12 / 3\n- Query surfaces / RAG fixtures: 7 / 5\n- Recommended RAG-HVY issues: 8\n- Production RAG reindex/vector mutation/runtime API/frontend/Supabase/external model calls: 0\n\n## Verification\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-final-closeout.mjs`\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-final-closeout.mjs --write`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-final-closeout.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (warning only: branch naming plus expected untracked files before commit)\n\n## Blockers\n- 3527 rows are terminally blocked in this chain by missing fresh semantic generation authorization / no local semantic support.\n- 3 raw candidates are review-required; no raw candidate is accepted truth.\n- Accepted/provisional runtime semantic edges remain 0 by design.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T05:16:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T05:20:21Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T05:20:20Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T05:20:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"fe65a4690760707870c8c0dcda33f3463a13f534","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"req